# A gestate editor session — replay it with
#
#     python -m gestate.sessionlog <this file>
#
#: editing untitled.ges
#
# Each line is a command and what it answered.  The
# answers are the diff: a replay that says something
# else is the report.

do
    #! playing untitled.ges at 44100 Hz — no parameters
    # 16 looks
    ask open 0 Path "examples/audio/bli"   #= 3 rows 701033a72f1fa7ad
    open "blip.wav"                        #= cannot open blip.wav: not a text file
    open "blip.wav"                        #= no file blip.wav — and a new .wav would not be text
